# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Build output
build/

# Local Go build caches (used when system GOCACHE is restricted)
.gocache/
.gotmp/

# data
data/

# TeX build artifacts (pdflatex: aux/log/toc/bbl/blg; kept local)
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg

# Paper bundle (lunwen): track only what reviewers need; ignore the rest.
# Large/external assets (zips, third-party references, binaries) stay local.
# NOTE: ignore direct children (lunwen/*), NOT the dir itself (lunwen/), so the
# ! negations below can re-include subdirectories for tracking.
lunwen/*
!lunwen/paper/
!lunwen/research-core/
!lunwen/clab-lab/
!lunwen/attachment/
# within attachment/: keep docs, configs, experiment JSONL, exp scripts; drop big items
lunwen/attachment/bin/
lunwen/attachment/*.zip
lunwen/attachment/paper/
# within clab-lab/: keep topology, config, README, frr, scripts, experiments-final;
# drop the old bulk jsonl under data/ (kept locally).
# NB: the global "data/" rule above excludes the whole dir; re-include the dir
# itself first, then ignore its children except experiments-final.
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/
lunwen/clab-lab/data/*
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/experiments-final/
#
# ── 2026-10-16（Task 20）：**实验数据集是证据，必须入库** ───────────────────
# 起因：上面那条 `lunwen/clab-lab/data/*` 与“数据集应当入库”这条惯例**正面冲突** ——
# 数据集此前只能靠 `git add -f` 进库（Task 19 的 `fa48ed8` 就是 69 个文件全用 `-f`），
# 于是“要不要入库”取决于**当班执行者记不记得加 `-f`**。实测代价（就在本目录里）：
#   `git ls-files lunwen/clab-lab/data | wc -l`                    → 146（进了库的）
#   `git status --ignored --porcelain lunwen/clab-lab/data | wc -l` →  33（在场却没进库的）
#   其中 3 个 `attack-*.json` / 13 个 `run.d/` 碎片 / 3 份 `records-*-smoke*.jsonl`
#   都有**已入库的同类兄弟**（如 12 个 `attack-*.json` 已入库）⇒ 半跟踪态。
# **证据的可得性不能取决于人的记性**，所以把这条惯例从“命令行动作”变成“写的规则”。
#
# 放行**两类证据本体**（其余仍按原样忽略）：
#   · `records-*.jsonl`           —— 每批实验的**记录集本体**（论文数据点，逐条可复核）
#   · `run-<8 位日期>-<pid>.json` —— 那一批的 **run 元数据**（口径/参数/门禁/耗时）
# 刻意**保持忽略**的（都不构成“论文数据点”）：
#   · `attack-*.json`  harness 原始产物 —— 与旧批次**同名**，平铺进同一目录会静默覆盖旧证据；
#   · `run.d*/`        现场碎片（每轮被 `edge_matrix.sh` 清掉）；
#   · `run.json` / `run-smoke1.json` —— 无批次号的临时件；
#   · `records-wsl-clab-14-20260912-smoke*.jsonl` —— 2026-09-12 的一次性 WSL 试跑
#     （其中一份还是 0 字节占位），**不是**论文数据点。
# ⚠️ 顺序不能反：git 的 `!` **无法穿透被排除的父目录**（教训见上面 49-50 行与 86-92 行）
#    ⇒ 必须**先** negate `edgefactors/` 这个目录本身，**再** negate 目录里的文件。
# ⚠️ 放行后新增的数据集文件会**直接以未跟踪出现**（不再静默消失）。复核：
#      git status --porcelain            # 新数据集必须是 `??`，不是“看不见”
#      git check-ignore -v <路径>        # 未命中任何规则 ⇒ rc=1（这才是“会被跟踪”）
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/
lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/*
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/records-*.jsonl
lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/records-wsl-clab-14-20260912-smoke*.jsonl
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/run-[0-9]*.json
# 2026-10-21（Task 24 = 计划 Task 6）：**拟合与选模的产物是交付物**，也要放行。
#   计划点名三件套：`fit-<date>.md` / `params-<date>.ini` / `params-<date>-factors.ini`；
#   另有四候选对比报告 `compare-<date>.md` 与独立诊断 `fit-<date>-diagnostics.md`
#   （`-rowlevel` 那份是"按行 vs 按实例重抽"的对照）。它们都是**证据本体**：
#   重跑虽然可行（同一 JSONL + 同一 seed），但"当时跑出来的是哪一份"必须能从仓内复核。
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/fit-*.md
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/params-*.ini
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/compare-*.md
# 2026-10-17（Task 23 收尾）：**归档的运行级证据目录** `run.d-<批次>/` 也要放行。
# 起因：`run.d*/` 被刻意忽略（每轮会被矩阵清掉的临时碎片），但**归档型**目录
#   `run.d-qemu-20261016/`（67 个）与 `run.d-t21-qemu-rpt/`（74 个）是**证据本体**
#   （门禁①/② 碎片、逐实例自检原文），Task 19/23 都是靠 `git add -f` 塞进来的 ——
#   同一个病根：**"要不要入库"取决于当班执行者记不记得加 `-f`**。
# ⇒ 按名字区分：`run.d/`（无后缀，临时）**保持忽略**；`run.d-<后缀>/`（归档）**放行**。
# ⚠️ 复核只能用 `git check-ignore -q`：命中**否定规则**时 `-v` 也返回 rc=0，
#    会把人骗成"被忽略"（Task 20 实测）。rc=1 才是"会被跟踪"。
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/run.d-*/
!lunwen/clab-lab/data/edgefactors/run.d-*/**
# Containerlab 的**生成目录**（destroy/deploy 时重建）：含 `.state.clab.yaml`、
# `topology-data.json`、ansible/nornir 清单，以及 `.tls/ca/ca.key`（**CA 私钥**）
# ⇒ 一律不入库。此前它"看不见"只是因为白名单被下方整目录规则误杀；
# 白名单修好后会重新出现为未跟踪文件，故在这里**显式**排除（把偶然变成明文）。
lunwen/clab-lab/clab-asscor/
# redundant zip copy of the final JSONL (the JSONL themselves are tracked)
lunwen/clab-lab/data/experiments-final/*.zip
# top-level zips (atomic-red-team, caldera) are large external assets: local only
lunwen/atomic-red-team-master.zip
lunwen/caldera-master.zip
# third-party reference papers: not part of the repo
lunwen/references/
# local backup of the paper bundle created by the author (lunwen - 副本)
lunwen?*/

# Paper bundle (lunwen): local-only assets on main. Selective tracking
# (whitelist) lives on the ASSCOR-Research-Core branch; main ignores the
# whole bundle including the "lunwen - 副本" backup (lunwen*/ matches both).
#
# ⚠️ 本分支（ASSCOR-Research-Core）**不得**再用 `lunwen/` 或 `lunwen*/` 整目录排除：
# git 无法在"父目录被排除"之后再 `!` 回某个文件（见上面第 49-50 行的白名单注释），
# 而 `lunwen*/` 也会匹配 `lunwen/` 本身 ⇒ 白名单**整体失效**，表现为
# "目录里新加的文件静默不被跟踪"。2026-09-12 Task 4D 实测：新增
# `lunwen/clab-lab/scripts/edge_lab.sh` 只能靠 `git add -f` 入库；
# 同类事故见下方 2026-09-08 的 `Asscor/` 条目（38fab56 的门控文件从未入库）。
# 备份目录 `lunwen - 副本/` 已由上面的 `lunwen?*/` 覆盖，第三方案例由 `lunwen/references/` 覆盖。


#.kilo
.kilo/

# (removed "Asscor/": git 对目录名大小写不敏感, 该规则误忽略 cmd/asscor/ 下
# 全部未跟踪 .go 文件(spc_on/off、attck_ext、checks_import_on、adapter_import_on),
# 导致 38fab56 的 attachSPC 门控文件从未入库 → main `-tags engine` 构建 cmd/asscor
# 报 undefined: attachSPC。2026-09-08 修复: 删除规则并补提交这些文件。)

# Audit reports (generated documentation, not tracked)
#docs/3-audits/

# v0.3.0 optional research direction (moved to lunwen/, no longer under docs/)
#（原“docs 下的 ASSCOR-Research-Core 目录”忽略规则已不再需要；研究资产在 lunwen/）

#.trae
.trae/

# TLS certificates and private keys
certs/

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Nested standalone module repositories (ssam-lib & prism-lib are independent
# Go modules vendored via go.mod replace directives). Their code files are
# tracked by this repo; these nested .git directories hold their own history
# and must never be committed or wiped by `git clean -fdx`.
ssam-lib/.git/
prism-lib/.git/

# Session artifacts (task briefs / reports / verdicts / surveys produced while
# working with the AI agent). These are process artifacts, not deliverables,
# and must never enter the repository.
#
# Why this rule exists even though the directory already ignores itself:
# the exclusion used to live ONLY in .superpowers/sdd/.gitignore (a single `*`),
# and that file is itself untracked -> deleting or re-cloning the directory
# removes the rule, at which point everything under it shows up as untracked
# and ONE `git add -A` swallows it all. Task 12 made the rule explicit here.
#
# NOTE: this is `.superpowers/` (leading dot, project root). It is a DIFFERENT
# path from the tracked document directories (`docs/1-current/design/` and
# `docs/4-archive/plans/`), which hold *tracked* design/plan documents
# and must stay tracked. Do not widen this rule.
.superpowers/

# Untracked local experiment config. Holds the C2 API key and the substrate
# address used by the edge-factor pipeline. It lives OUTSIDE the repository
# (e.g. ~/.config/asscor/edgeexp.local.env) -- this rule only guards against
# someone copying it in by accident.
edgeexp.local.env

